Hi Pablo,

> I´m new in the group and with R in general. I have a question about how
> I can do a scatterplot with error bars. I´m working with stable isotopes
> so I have data on D13C and D15N for faunal samples. I want to obtain a

> plot like this one (without convex hulls) attached (target)target.png

It looks to me like you have your x and y axes confused when
calling the errorbar functions.

+geom_errorbar(aes(ymax=D15N+D15N.ds,ymin=D15N-D15N.ds))
+geom_errorbarh(aes(xmax=D13C+D13C.ds,xmin=D13C-D13C.ds))

should be better.

You might get more help, and quicker, by using the rstudio
community (https://community.rstudio.com) as there isn't much traffic
on this list these days.

Hope this is helpful,
Ron.

